  "citation": "O'Brien J; Tuftedal M; Muradyan P; Wawrzyniak E; Grover M; Collis S; Sankaran R; Beckman P; Ferrier N; Shahkarami S; Kim Y; Park S; Conrad N (2024): CROCUS Weather Data at Argonne National Laboratory Prairie Site. Community Research on Climate and Urban Science Urban Integrated Field Laboratory (CROCUS UIFL). Dataset. doi:10.15485/2482528",
  "dataset": {
