    "measurementTechnique": [
      "Direct measurements from the Vaisala-WXT536 sensor include temperature, humidity, wind speed, wind direction, and rainfall rate as well as accumulation. Derived variables include dewpoint. Rainfall is measured using an acoustic rain gauge.",
      "Datasets were ingested to daily files, adding in temporal averaging to ensure the data is easier to work with."
    ],
